// MR. MAS — Ep1 full v3, the `v3-art-b` pass (Acts Two, Three and the tag): one demo still per new asset state, the
// stills sheet's registry (tools/sheet.ts). Each demo paints the 480 x 203 picture area of a native frame the way the
// v3 shot would use the asset, so the sheet shows the asset in its framing, not on a blank. These are previews, not the
// v3 layouts: the per-segment shot passes (`v3-shots-<seg>`) own the shots. Keys are `ID@state`; the beat each still
// serves is in its note (the beat plan's ids: show/episodes/ep01/production/full-v3/beat-plan/*.json).
